Transaction Start Hone Ka Matlab Kya Hai?

Jab hum "transaction start hoti hai" bolte hain, iska matlab hota hai ki:

Message processing ek secure block ke andar hoti hai, jisme:

Agar sab kuch theek ho gaya to commit hota hai (changes permanently save).

Agar koi error aa gaya to rollback hota hai (koi bhi changes save nahi hote).




---

Real-life Example se Samajh:

Tu ek bank soch:

Tu kisi ko ₹500 bhej raha hai (yeh tera message hai).

Agar paise successfully cut gaye aur samne wale ko mil gaye, tabhi transaction complete hoti hai (commit).

Agar beech me system down ho gaya ya paise cut gaye lekin samne wale ko nahi mile — to poora process rollback ho jaata hai, paise wapas aa jaate hain.


Yeh hota hai "transaction start hona" — jisme system ensure karta hai ki ya to poora kaam ho ya bilkul bhi na ho.


---

TimeoutNotification Node ke Context me:

Jab transaction start hoti hai, to node message ko secure transaction block me process karta hai.

Jab transaction start nahi hoti, to message bas aise hi process ho jaata hai — koi rollback nahi hota.



